//============================================================================
//  gx_zoomtab.svh -- MAME's sprite zoom arithmetic as constant tables
//
//  Included inside gx_objscan and gx_objdraw (module scope, like gx_rommap.svh).
//  Case functions over constants, not initialised arrays: root L-032, Quartus
//  17.0 dropped an `initial` table this lane's simulator kept.
//
//  gx_zrecip   k053246_k053247_k055673.h:146-153
//                zoom = scale ? (0x400000 + (scale >> 1)) / scale : 0x800000
//              the on-screen size of a 16-dot tile, in 12-bit fixed point
//  gx_zstride  zdrawgfxzoom32GP (.cpp:464-465): src_stride = (16 << 19) / size
//              generated 2026-09-14 from those two expressions
//============================================================================
function automatic [23:0] gx_zrecip(input [9:0] s);
    case (s)
        10'd0: gx_zrecip = 24'h800000;
        10'd1: gx_zrecip = 24'h400000;
